  "faqQ1": "Are my chats really safe?",
  "faqA1": "All 1:1 and group chats are end-to-end encrypted. The server and the operator can't read them.",
  "faqQ2": "Can I sign up without a phone number?",
  "faqA2": "Yes. You only need an ID and a password. We don't use phone numbers or contacts.",
  "faqQ3": "Will I lose my chats if I change phones?",
  "faqA3": "Make a chat recovery key and you can open your old chats on a new phone. Only you have the key, so if you lose it nobody can bring them back.",
  "faqQ4": "Who can find me?",
  "faqA4": "Only people who know your ID. Nobody can find you by name or phone number.",
  "faqQ5": "How do I turn on disappearing messages?",
  "faqA5": "Tap the timer button at the top of a chat and pick a time. Messages sent after that disappear when the time is up.",
  "faqQ6": "What is a bubble?",
  "faqA6": "A photo that disappears once it's opened. The home-screen widget shows only the bubble, never the content.",
  "faqQ7": "Can I lock the app?",
  "faqA7": "Set a password in Settings > Privacy and Security and the app asks for it every time it opens.",
  "faqQ8": "Can I edit or delete a sent message?",
  "faqA8": "Touch and hold a message to edit or delete it. Deleted messages disappear for the other person too.",
